WEBVTT

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:57.320
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:30.800
Hey!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.670
Gara, why do you want
to become a ninja?

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.970
'Cuz I want to be strong!

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.900
Stronger than your father?

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.750
Of course!

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:45.040
Very well.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.260
And, when you are the
strongest man in the world...

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:50.540
...how will you feel then?

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.270
We've got trouble!
Dark Schneider has!

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.050
What?! You're saying
he defeated Efreet?!

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:48.000
Yeah! I just saw him
do it with my own eyes!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.910
Then... He'll be here soon...

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.670
Lord Gara!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.460
Y- You don't look too good.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.260
What happened to all that
confidence you had before?

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.500
If you try acting too nice
just 'cuz he's your old friend...

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.460
...Rushe's gonna kill you!

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:16.350
I hope he kills a pervert
like you as soon as he can.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.160
For crying out loud...

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.560
Lord Gara,
Dark Schneider is!

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:23.010
- Lord Gara!
- Lord Gara!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:31.940
Well! Looks like I'm
surrounded by gutless cowards!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.090
Quit standing around,
you morons! Is this clear?

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.650
I don't need any of you butting
into this fight!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.480
Got that?!

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.780
Yes, sir!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.750
N- Now what?! If you try
anything perverted again...

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:49.870
So, if I act nice to him,
he'll kill me, huh?

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.920
Yeah! You got
a problem with that?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.540
Never mind, young lady.
You don't have to know about him.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.060
Rushe!

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.080
He's finally here!
The legendary wizard.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.560
Dark Schneider!

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:26.800
You came to save me?
You really did?

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.120
So, you've finally come...

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.540
Dark Schnei...

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:54.600
Oh, what was that?
Oh, no. It's started!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:06.130
Gara... How dare you
try something like this!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:11.430
How nostalgic. It's been
15 years, hasn't it?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:16.440
Shut up! Just what do you
mean by kidnapping my woman?!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.660
Woman?

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.640
Oh, do you mean THIS woman?

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:22.380
Huh?

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:25.600
What?!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.100
What's this thing for?!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:42.980
Tia!

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:49.310
Pervert!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.060
Sorry about that, little lady!

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:56.820
Hey, guys! We don't need her
anymore, so keep her quiet!

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.140
Just don't be too rough with her.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.860
You guys don't know
how to treat a lady...

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.240
...so she'd just be wasted on you.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.870
Now, then... Huh?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.900
YOU SON OF A BITCH!!!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.730
YOU TOOK HER CLOTHES OFF?!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.520
YOU LITTLE SHIT!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:20.310
EVEN <i>I HAVEN'T
GOTTEN TO SEE THAT YET!!!</i>

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.230
What?!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.890
You're causing all
this trouble over that?!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.570
Shut up!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.540
Damn! You weakling!

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:47.100
Did fighting Efreet use
up all your strength?!

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.540
She's a very sweet girl, you know.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:56.000
Certainly worth coming all
this way to save. However...

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.400
You're not that sort of a guy!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.570
You're wicked! You're vicious!

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:01.910
You're cold-hearted!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.390
Rushe!

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.500
All right!
Lord Gara's incredible!

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:10.780
Didn't they call you a devil...

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:14.220
...who'd happily try
any dirty trick to win?!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.170
And yet you come all
this way to save one girl!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.150
And, more than that, you're helping
those people in Meta-Rikana...

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.610
Why are you doing it?!

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.500
Stop this, Ninja Master Gara!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:32.920
<i>Princess Sheela!</i>
<i>Why is she protecting Rushe?</i>

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.980
Challenging one as
strong as you is one thing...

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.800
...but just bullying a weaker
opponent is the act of a coward!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.240
Doesn't that violate
the Code of the Ninja?!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:46.030
Hm, the Code of the Ninja, huh?

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:49.230
There was a code I had posted
on the wall that I'd follow.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.520
But I stopped after that guy
on the floor destroyed it!

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:58.210
Hey! Gara, what are
you doing this for?!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:59.870
He was once your friend!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.300
Aren't you even gonna
try to talk to him?!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:05.160
You were so worried before
until Rushe showed up!

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:12.300
Hey! Do something
about these women!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.600
I will not get out of the way.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.190
- Sheela...
- Yes?

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.270
Stand aside.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:18.790
But...

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.710
You have to save Yoko!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.990
I understand... Dark Schneider!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.200
Don't die.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.700
Of course!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.220
Lord Gara's using the Murasame!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.330
I still haven't forgotten,
Dark Schneider!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.140
I almost killed
you once, long ago...

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.150
Now we'll settle things!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:09.140
I thought Dark Schneider
and Gara were once friends...

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.370
But... But, then,
why is this fight?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.790
Gara!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:18.300
If you lay a finger on Rushe,
I'll never forgive you!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.220
Rushe'll take care of a guy like
you! Like this and this and!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.400
Rushe...

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:34.070
Look! The moon's out, like on that
night when I fought you before.

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:36.700
Back then, I was
just a novice ninja...

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.490
...serving the king of a
small kingdom to the east.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:46.630
Back then, an invader appeared to
threaten our kingdom.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.240
<i>It was...</i>

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.570
<i>It was a huge army that followed</i>
<i>a course no one could understand!</i>

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.110
<i>It was YOUR army!</i>

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.260
<i>When your men crossed</i>
<i>the river the month before...</i>

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.330
<i>...I figured you'd</i>
<i>keep heading south.</i>

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.140
Dammit! Which way
is he going to go?!

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:15.770
I think it's obvious his
current target is our kingdom.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:18.230
If what we hear is true and...

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.850
...we face 50 to 100
thousand troops, we can't win.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.350
The problem is...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.900
You idiot! We palace ninja...

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:29.260
...are expected to sacrifice
our lives to protect the king!

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.740
Well, that's easy to say.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:35.730
Then lemme ask you this: Do
you know what this guy's after?

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:37.460
That's not our concern.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:40.800
Yes, it is! Don't you know how
weird this guy's supposed to be?

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:43.200
You mean the way he's going
around destroying kingdoms...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.080
...without trying to
actually take them over?

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.380
Exactly! I don't
understand this guy!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.880
How can he get tens of thousands
of troops to follow him?

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.490
Look, we have to defend our king.
What else can we do?

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.750
Knock it off!

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:05.450
Majesty, I've a
request to ask of you.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:10.480
What is it?! Don't you realize
what a crisis we're facing?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.900
Just this, Majesty:

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.810
I wish to seek single
combat with someone.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:17.620
Combat with whom?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.150
Dark Schneider.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.900
What?! By yourself?!

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.000
Yes!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.530
Admirable... You may do it, Gara.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:29.490
I salute this palace's
most skilled fighter.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.810
I place the fate of our
kingdom in your hands.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:37.920
You are the only one who can
bring peace to our people!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:50.300
If you can lay
his head before me...

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.410
...I will reward you with
the title of Ninja Master.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.890
Aye! It would be
my pleasure, Your Majesty!

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.270
You! Are you Dark Schneider?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:47.960
Answer me!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:53.490
You are him... I am Gara,
High Ninja of Ministoria!

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.230
I have come for your head!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:04.420
For crying out loud. It's
such a nice, moonlit night...

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.760
...and I STILL get bugs
crawling into my room.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:09.680
And the mosquitos
seem attracted to me.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:10.850
Don't you agree?

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.560
You do seem to have
some backbone, though.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.600
That because you're bigger
than most mosquitos?

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.270
Dark Schneider!
I want to ask you something!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.330
Why do you fight?! Why do you
destroy? Why do you plunder?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:42.050
If you have a reason, I want
you to tell me what it is!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.800
You want to know what I'm after?

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:51.600
I like your attitude! Okay,
then! This is what I'm after:

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:56.660
I want to kill every last
ugly, gorilla-man like you...

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.280
...so I can have all the
women in the world for myself!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.010
You make jokes...

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.170
Answer me!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.480
Wh- Where?

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.640
<i>What I'm after is conquest</i>
<i>of the entire world!</i>

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:33.080
What?! Then why aren't
you interested in ruling?

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.890
Let's forget about the
kingdoms you've destroyed already.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:41.390
If you're just, rule with justice!
If you're evil, be a tyrant!

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.300
Why won't you rule them?!
You're a conqueror, aren't you?!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:48.230
Now, all the kingdoms you've
smashed are just left in chaos!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:57.240
<i>What do I care about that?</i>
<i>I'm taking the world!</i>

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:59.440
<i>I'm taking it!</i>

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:04.180
I never knew that happened...

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:06.900
And then? What happened?

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.330
Dark Schneider! I will
ask you one more time!

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:18.110
What are you after?
Conquest of the world?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:25.350
I told you! What I want is to
get rid of gorilla-men like you!

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:27.160
Fine! Just try it!

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:32.930
I'll show you just how powerful
I've become in the last 15 years!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:36.170
Fine with me. Hurry up and
come at me so I can kill you!

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:38.880
Let's go, Murasame Blade!

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:58.690
My Murasame Blade can
cut without touching you!

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.510
How will you fight it?!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.970
Magic! Your magic!
Why won't you use it?!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:19.160
Dark Schneider!
Show me your special magic!

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:20.610
Yeah!
What's wrong with you?!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.470
You're the legendary
wizard, aren't you?!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.720
Hey! Hold on here!

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:32.150
No! Don't!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.640
Hey! Come on!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.520
You're all right.
You aren't hurt, are you?

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.760
Princess Sheela...

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:46.470
Tia, you're very
important to him.

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:48.750
To him?

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.700
All you do is complain.

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:56.870
Rule? All you do is complain.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.050
You're the one who
complains all the time!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.250
You don't mean anything you say!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.360
What?!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.030
You can't beat me with physical
strength alone! Fool!

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:16.110
After you died, we four decided...

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:21.180
...to finish the war to conquer
the world which you began!

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:25.670
For 15 years we've fought!
We've gotten this far!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.850
And now that you've come waltzing
back into the picture...

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.600
...we won't let you screw it up!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.080
What's so funny?!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.570
I've got you!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.620
Zazard, zazard,
scrono-rono-sook...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.140
Lord Gara!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.970
That's right.
After using Exodus...

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.900
...that's the only spell
left for you to use.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.390
Become my sword and
strike down my enemy!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.100
Demon Sword!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:05.000
Gara...
You just scratched me.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.650
VENOM!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.300
Damn!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.290
Lord Gara!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.270
<i>Now! Before he can</i>
<i>cast another spell!</i>

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.230
DEMON SWORD!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.280
Efreet!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.220
Master!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.550
You've changed
from the man you were.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.130
You have a lot of
people defending you.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.940
Some that even throw
themselves in front of me...

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.180
...to sacrifice
their lives for you!

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:02.260
That's not the
Dark Schneider I knew!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:05.700
Tell me! Who are you?!
Why are you here?!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.630
You look like Dark Schneider,
but you act nothing like him!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:14.360
You aren't Dark Schneider!
And if you aren't him...

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:15.910
If I'm not, then what?

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:20.340
What do you think?
I'll kill you! Kill you dead!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.910
With a technique even more
powerful than the Demon Sword!

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:27.260
Now die, along with the legend
of your invincibility!

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.580
True Demon Sword!

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.050
No...

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.710
Did that do it?

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.620
Have I... Did I?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.140
...finally kill him?

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:25.050
He did it!
Dark Schneider is dead!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:27.560
NO!!!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.250
Tia!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.360
<i>You're no conqueror!</i>

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:38.490
Oh? Then what am I?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:39.710
A devil!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.560
And what will you do about it?

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:46.050
Kill you... It's the only
way to save the world!

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:51.170
Save the world? Is that
what you're planning?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:55.620
What can you accomplish by
defending a piddling little kingdom?

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:57.990
No, what do you <i>want</i> to do?

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.210
Sh- Shut up!

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.150
- Damned!
- Demon Sword!

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.540
D- Dark Schneider...

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:41.780
I like your style, Gara.

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.030
<i>In that instant, I understood.</i>

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:49.770
<i>Why I so wanted to meet you</i>
<i>that I volunteered for this.</i>

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:53.550
<i>Why I wanted to know who you</i>
<i>were and what your goals were.</i>

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.970
<i>To be honest, I admired you.</i>

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:03.780
<i>Ever since I was a kid,</i>
<i>I wanted to be stronger than anyone.</i>

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:09.040
<i>But all that meant was</i>
<i>gaining power over people.</i>

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.080
<i>What was the meaning of it?</i>

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.610
<i>Become the king of some kingdom...</i>

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:20.900
<i>...just so I could ignore my poor</i>
<i>people and fight wars? Foolishness.</i>

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:25.570
<i>But, with you, I figured</i>
<i>I could have the power to...</i>

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:31.300
<i>...conquer everything and then start</i>
<i>it all over from the beginning.</i>

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:38.180
It's not an illusion this time.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:09.480
Prepare a feast!
Tonight we drink!

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:11.630
Come on! Wine and women!
Bring them on!

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:14.400
On second thought,
just bring wine!

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:21.720
Wait, shut up!
Everyone, be quiet!

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:31.660
What's that?

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:39.260
Da... Da...

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:45.330
What's happening?!

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:48.160
<i>Gara! You've done</i>
<i>well as my follower!</i>

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:51.110
<i>I give you credit for</i>
<i>15 years of fine work!</i>

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:54.000
<i>Isn't it wonderful?!</i>
<i>The resonance of the spirits...</i>

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.510
<i>...and magical power which</i>
<i>fills the air and the earth!</i>

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:59.180
Impossible! This is his magic?!

00:23:59.730 --> 00:24:02.000
<i>Day Boom Stain!</i>

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:05.570
- Here it comes!
- <i>Spirits of earth and air!</i>

00:24:06.060 --> 00:24:09.370
<i>Honor the ancient pact and</i>
<i>fulfill your duty to me!</i>

00:24:09.650 --> 00:24:11.000
<i>MEGA D'SU!</i>

00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:20.660
<i>Gara! This is TRUE power!</i>

00:24:34.800 --> 00:24:37.160
<i>I like your style, Gara.</i>

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:40.870
<i>Dark Schneider... Let me join you.</i>

00:24:41.080 --> 00:24:43.460
<i>Oh? But aren't I a devil?</i>

00:24:43.760 --> 00:24:45.090
<i>I'm aware of that.</i>

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:48.880
<i>Okay, then I'll give you this.</i>

00:24:48.910 --> 00:24:50.030
<i>Th- This is!</i>

00:24:50.060 --> 00:24:52.740
<i>The Murasame Blade.</i>
<i>I don't like it that much.</i>

00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:03.660
Hey, Gara! You dead yet?

00:25:06.750 --> 00:25:10.380
Is your arm back already?
That's a dirty trick...

00:25:10.410 --> 00:25:12.910
...especially after I risked my life
to get in one blow with my sword.

00:25:12.940 --> 00:25:16.570
Ah, forget about it.
Yours is back, too, isn't it?

00:25:22.760 --> 00:25:27.490
Anyway, what the heck was
that last spell you used?

00:25:28.440 --> 00:25:29.780
It was incredible!

00:25:31.260 --> 00:25:33.180
YOU JERK!!!

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:37.150
If you had a big spell like that,
why didn't you use it right away?!

00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:38.640
I was so worried about you!

00:25:38.670 --> 00:25:40.790
You... You girls?

00:25:41.340 --> 00:25:43.960
This jerk's shield
protected us from the blast.

00:25:46.210 --> 00:25:48.270
Hey!

00:25:48.300 --> 00:25:49.970
Lord Gara!

00:25:52.200 --> 00:25:54.870
<i>Impossible. How could</i>
<i>he have shielded them...</i>

00:25:54.900 --> 00:25:57.510
<i>...during a battle that was using</i>
<i>nearly all his strength and power?</i>

00:25:58.010 --> 00:26:02.250
That's really cold!
And after I came to save you!

00:26:02.280 --> 00:26:05.000
Oh, sure! You forgot
all about me in there!

00:26:05.030 --> 00:26:08.250
What do you think we
were fighting so hard about?!

00:26:08.280 --> 00:26:12.460
- Oh, forget it!
- Oh, Yoko, come on!

00:26:14.540 --> 00:26:18.290
<i>Dark Schneider... You're an enigma.</i>

00:26:18.970 --> 00:26:22.070
<i>In the middle of a battle</i>
<i>to the death with an enemy...</i>

00:26:22.100 --> 00:26:25.990
<i>...you're able to protect</i>
<i>that which the enemy loves.</i>

00:26:41.080 --> 00:26:44.760
I lost again.
